<title>UK: UK leading European job creation, Treasury says.</title>
<headline>UK leading European job creation, Treasury says.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The UK is leading the way in job creation in Europe, the British Treasury said.  </p>
<p>&quot;Competitive Britain is leading the way for job creation in Europe,&quot; a Treasury stateement said.</p>
<p>DATA TODAY SHOWED</p>
<p>=================</p>
<p>UK SEPT UNEMPLOYMENT FALLS 35,600, RATE 7.4%</p>
<p>UK JULY UNDERLYING AVG EARNINGS REVISED UP TO 4.0% FROM PRVS 3.75%</p>
<p>UK UNIT WAGE COSTS 3.7% IN 3MTHS TO JULY VS YR EARLIER, AUG FIGS DUE NEXT WK</p>
<p>-- John Speck, London Newsroom +44 171 542-8663</p>
